{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14104510.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14104510","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14104510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1410451001:0":{"text":"시레이, 거기 서! 어서 이 문제부터 해결해 달라고!","source_cn":"席蕾，你站住！快来给我解决事情！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAF20275322C85DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410451002:1":{"text":"오.. 여왕님이시여, 또 저 사람인가...","source_cn":"哦……女王在上，怎么又是他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1DB28F58CEFEEE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410451003:1":{"text":"크흠, 라세른 님. 무슨 일이신가요?","source_cn":"咳——拉瑟隆大人，有何吩咐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58ABC8A94698546D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410451004:1":{"text":"하인 하나가 내가 낮잠을 자는 동안 도망쳤어! 이건 명백한 도발이야. 내 존엄을 짓밟는 행위라고!","source_cn":"一个仆从竟然趁我午憩之时逃跑！这是活生生的挑衅！是践踏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F3241B1564FF41E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410451005:0":{"text":"당장 잡아와. 어서! 그 자의 피로 이 치욕을 씻어낼 것이다!","source_cn":"你们得把她抓回来，立刻！马上！我要用她的鲜血洗刷耻辱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56BDC7311DDF46F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410451006:0":{"text":"만약 실패하면...","source_cn":"如果你们做不到——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC250986098B825C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410451007:0":{"text":"이 평민 근위병의 머리로... 우리 집 대문을 장식하겠어!","source_cn":"我会用新的装饰品……比如，这个平民卫兵的脑袋来点缀我家大门！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAABC8B8153644C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410451008:1":{"text":"또 저러네. 한두 번도 아니고.","source_cn":"拉瑟隆又来了，这事可不是一次两次了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x435A983F90703907","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"또 저러네. 한두 번도 아니고.","female":"또 저러네. 한두 번도 아니고.","variant_male_record_index":"158685","variant_female_record_index":"158686","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1410451008":{"text":"또 저러네. 한두 번도 아니고.","source_cn":"拉瑟隆又来了，这事可不是一次两次了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x435A983F90703907","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"또 저러네. 한두 번도 아니고.","female":"또 저러네. 한두 번도 아니고.","variant_male_record_index":"158685","variant_female_record_index":"158686","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410451009:0":{"text":"임무를 완수하긴 했지만, 잡혀간 사람들은... 짐작 가지?","source_cn":"我们完成了任务，但被抓回来的人……你一定能想象他们的下场。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBA21E2CC6FEBAF48","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"임무를 완수하긴 했지만, 잡혀간 사람들은... 짐작 가지?","female":"임무를 완수하긴 했지만, 잡혀간 사람들은... 짐작 가지?","variant_male_record_index":"158687","variant_female_record_index":"158688","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410451011:1":{"text":"그 하인이 어디에 숨어 있을 지 대충 짐작이 가. 훈련 삼아 해볼 간단한 임무네. 가자.","source_cn":"我大概知道她躲在哪里。这是个简单的练手任务，走吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAEBE3CEF391E6E20","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그 하인이 어디에 숨어 있을 지 대충 짐작이 가. 훈련 삼아 해볼 간단한 임무네. 가자.","female":"그 하인이 어디에 숨어 있을 지 대충 짐작이 가. 훈련 삼아 해볼 간단한 임무네. 가자.","variant_male_record_index":"158691","variant_female_record_index":"158692","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"지난번에는 어떻게 됐어?","source_cn":"之前的结果如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA6FF66E9CF16DDA7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"지난번에는 어떻게 됐어?","female":"지난번에는 어떻게 됐어?","variant_male_record_index":"71782","variant_female_record_index":"71783","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410451010:0":{"text":"맞아. 저런 주인을 만나다니, 운도 참 나빠.","source_cn":"是啊，他们命运不济，摊上这样的主人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9AA7B71BC338D9D8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"맞아. 저런 주인을 만나다니, 운도 참 나빠.","female":"맞아. 저런 주인을 만나다니, 운도 참 나빠.","variant_male_record_index":"158689","variant_female_record_index":"158690","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"왜 도망쳤는지 이해는 가네","source_cn":"我理解他们为何逃跑","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA36FC11E60885F43","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"왜 도망쳤는지 이해는 가네","female":"왜 도망쳤는지 이해는 가네","variant_male_record_index":"71784","variant_female_record_index":"71785","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:趾高气扬的贵族":{"text":"기고만장한 귀족","source":"趾高气扬的贵族","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:席蕾":{"text":"시레이","source":"席蕾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:拉瑟隆":{"text":"라세른","source":"拉瑟隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep4/quest_story/14104511.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14104511","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14104511","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1410451101:0":{"text":"살려주세요, 살려주세요! 다시는 도망치지 않겠습니다!","source_cn":"救命啊！救命！大人，救救我！我再也不会跑了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3ACEE07E4472288","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"살려주세요, 살려주세요! 다시는 도망치지 않겠습니다!","female":"살려주세요, 살려주세요! 다시는 도망치지 않겠습니다!","variant_male_record_index":"158693","variant_female_record_index":"158694","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1410451102:0":{"text":"여기 죄악화된 자가 있어! 이야기는 나중에 하고 일단 저 사람부터 구하자!","source_cn":"这里竟然会有孽化者！待会再说，先把她救下！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x46C96F423069A5B3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"여기 죄악화된 자가 있어! 이야기는 나중에 하고 일단 저 사람부터 구하자!","female":"여기 죄악화된 자가 있어! 이야기는 나중에 하고 일단 저 사람부터 구하자!","variant_male_record_index":"158695","variant_female_record_index":"158696","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:无措的女仆":{"text":"어쩔 줄 모르는 메이드","source":"无措的女仆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:席蕾":{"text":"시레이","source":"席蕾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"loca