h64":"0x9FB0F19DC4EC610F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아니, 전 아무것도 못 봤어요!","female":"아니, 전 아무것도 못 봤어요!","variant_male_record_index":"158701","variant_female_record_index":"158702","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410452005:1":{"text":"진정하고 사실대로 말하면 형량이 줄어들 수도 있을 거야.","source_cn":"冷静点，告诉我们实情，也许能减轻你的处罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF794CE9332E1CFF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410452006:0":{"text":"당신은 몰라요... 어쨌든, 저는 아무것도 못 봤어요. 아무 말도 안 한 거예요!","source_cn":"您不明白……总之，我什么都没看见！什么都没说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD546478EF3D8FF52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410452007:1":{"text":"하아... 그러면 너를 제사장님께 넘기는 수밖에.","source_cn":"唉，既然如此，那我就把你交给祭司大人们吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CE500C0888A5443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1410452007":{"text":"하아... 그러면 너를 제사장님께 넘기는 수밖에.","source_cn":"唉，既然如此，那我就把你交给祭司大人们吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CE500C0888A5443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410452008:1":{"text":"...지난 일을 되풀이하고 싶지 않아.","source_cn":"……我不想让过去再重演了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64